>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></p>","file":"ch03-linear-systems/04-elementary-matrices-and-inverses.html"}